  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ljtn/epiq/zipball/v1.8.6",
  "body": "* **Board and project management:** Create, rename, and switch boards from the GUI; preserve project identity across checkouts; and expose board creation to agents.\r\n* **Timeline exploration:** Add the Flow layout, text and ticket filtering, improved series narrowing, Spotlight mode, and clearer impact-based controls.\r\n* **Event log:** Make the log resizable and detachable, with configurable columns, actor lanes, improved navigation, and inline diff statistics.\r\n* **Interface polish:** Improve spacing, controls, icon buttons, ticket cards, tags, agent labels, segment boundaries, and dock interactions.\r\n* **Reliability and testing:** Make event ordering locale-independent, validate writes against live nodes, improve drag-test coverage, and handle release binaries more safely.\r\n"
}
